{%- doc -%}
  Shared navigation for the four Tueste experiences.

  @param {string} [current] - Active experience: tienda, tree, unity or records
  @param {string} [theme] - Optional visual variant, such as records
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign tree_page = pages['tueste-tree']
  assign unity_page = pages['tueste-unity']
  assign records_page = pages['tueste-records']
  assign tree_url = tree_page.url | default: '/pages/tueste-tree'
  assign unity_url = unity_page.url | default: '/pages/tueste-unity'
  assign records_url = records_page.url | default: '/pages/tueste-records'
  assign current_experience = current | default: 'tienda'
-%}

<section class="tu-universe tu-universe--{{ theme | default: 'tueste' }}" aria-labelledby="tu-universe-title-{{ current_experience }}">
  <div class="tu-universe__inner">
    <p class="tu-universe__kicker">Universo Tueste</p>
    <h2 class="tu-universe__title" id="tu-universe-title-{{ current_experience }}">Un origen, <em>cuatro caminos</em>.</h2>
    <p class="tu-universe__intro">Todo nace en el mismo cafetal del Cañón de Aures: el café que compras, el árbol que siembras, la marca que creas con nosotros y la música que lo cuenta.</p>
    <div class="tu-universe__cards" role="list">
      <a class="tu-universe__card{% if current_experience == 'tienda' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ routes.root_url }}#inicio"{% if current_experience == 'tienda' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} role="listitem" aria-label="Tienda Tueste">
        <div class="tu-universe__card-top"><span class="tu-universe__number">01</span>{% if current_experience == 'tienda' %}<b>Estás aquí</b>{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="tu-universe__logo"><img src="{{ 'tueste-logo-glass.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Tueste" loading="lazy" width="700" height="242"></div>
        <p>Café de origen, piezas y ritual. La casa de todo lo que hacemos.</p><span class="tu-universe__enter">Entrar →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tu-universe__card{% if current_experience == 'tree' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ tree_url }}"{% if current_experience == 'tree' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} role="listitem" aria-label="Tueste Tree">
        <div class="tu-universe__card-top"><span class="tu-universe__number">02</span>{% if current_experience == 'tree' %}<b>Estás aquí</b>{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="tu-universe__logo"><img src="{{ 'tueste-universo-tree.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Tueste Tree" loading="lazy" width="610" height="294"></div>
        <p>Siembra un árbol en la Finca Tres Esquinas y cofunda un origen.</p><span class="tu-universe__enter">Entrar →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tu-universe__card{% if current_experience == 'unity' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ unity_url }}"{% if current_experience == 'unity' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} role="listitem" aria-label="Tueste Unity">
        <div class="tu-universe__card-top"><span class="tu-universe__number">03</span>{% if current_experience == 'unity' %}<b>Estás aquí</b>{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="tu-universe__logo"><img src="{{ 'tueste-universo-unity.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Tueste Unity" loading="lazy" width="700" height="242"></div>
        <p>Tu marca de café con nuestro origen y una firma sonora.</p><span class="tu-universe__enter">Entrar →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tu-universe__card{% if current_experience == 'records' %} is-active{% endif %}" href="{{ records_url }}"{% if current_experience == 'records' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} role="listitem" aria-label="Tueste Records">
        <div class="tu-universe__card-top"><span class="tu-universe__number">04</span>{% if current_experience == 'records' %}<b>Estás aquí</b>{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="tu-universe__logo"><img src="{{ 'tueste-universo-records.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Tueste Records" loading="lazy" width="700" height="242"></div>
        <p>El sello: lanzamientos, artistas y dónde escuchar el café.</p><span class="tu-universe__enter">Entrar →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
